 "notes": [
  "Segment formerly 'Commodity Insights' is published as 'Energy' (code CI). Mobility still reported as a segment (spin not yet completed).",
  "Exhibit 1 'Expenses' (2,344) excludes gain on dispositions (175); segment exhibit 'Total expenses' (2,169) nets the gain (172 in Market Intelligence, 3 in corporate).",
  "Equity in income on unconsolidated subsidiaries is '—' (OSTTRA sold in Q4-25).",
  "Exhibit 1 prints 'Other (income) expense, net' = (2), i.e. income -> oth_inc = 2.",
  "Exhibit 5 adjusted net income prints only an aggregate 'Non-GAAP adjustments' line (-121 after tax, $(0.41)/share). Footnote items after tax sum to -122 (computed). Pre-tax: operating -119, interest -6 (premium amortization benefit); tax on non-GAAP adjustments -4.",
  "Energy footnote (c) items sum to 2 pre-tax vs Non-GAAP adjustments 3 printed; Indices footnote (e) sums to 2 vs 1 printed (company rounding).",
  "Adjusted interest expense printed 103 vs 96 + 6 = 102 (computed; rounding).",
  "Deal-related amortization pre-tax 276 = segments 275 + corporate 1; tax 70; after tax 206.",
  "FCF adjusting items are relabelled from 2026: 'Employee severance and transition costs' and 'Acquisition and disposition-related costs' (2025 comparative restated to 70 / 15).",
  "Balance sheet: assets / liabilities held for sale relate to the anticipated divestiture of Energy's geoscience and petroleum engineering software portfolio and the Centennial, Colorado facility.",
  "Capex and NCI distributions recorded as positive costs; fcf_items as printed.",
  "2026 outlook adjusted only (except reported revenue growth and capex); guidance assumes Mobility for the full year. Adjusted free cash flow excluding certain items expected to grow mid-single digits."
 ],
